<title>UK: TABLE-Vodafone year profit rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Vodafone year profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			  (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		11.89		  vs 10.15</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.45		   vs N/A</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 4.81		   vs 4.01</p>
<p> Pretax		     539		    vs 475</p>
<p> Turnover		   1.75 bln	     vs 1.40</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 525 and 543 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Vodafone Group Plc.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
